    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aeeae1ca10378.49748678\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard is addressing the issue of NPCs and mobs being briefly duplicated across each layer.<br><br>For a brief period of time, NPCs and mobs had multiple copies of themselves, creating some very dangerous areas, or many clones of the same NPC. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307666.jpg\" id=\"1307666\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307666.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77778 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2118797813677166661\">Tweet #2118797813677166661</a></div></div><br><br>Blizzard posted in a server message that this is being worked on after a \"blip in the multiverse\".<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"false\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">[SERVER] Greetings! There was a slight blip in the multiverse. We are in the process of de-blipping all zones now.</div></div><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307667.png\" id=\"1307667\"><img width=\"250\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307667.png?maxWidth=250\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 11.0208 / 1;\"></a></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard is addressing the issue of NPCs and mobs being briefly duplicated across each layer.<br /><br />For a brief period of time, NPCs and mobs had multiple copies of themselves, creating some very dangerous areas, or many clones of the same NPC. <br /><br />Blizzard posted in a server message that this is being worked on after a &quot;blip in the multiverse&quot;.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"> Greetings! There was a slight blip in the multiverse. We are in the process of de-blipping all zones now. </div><br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
